# Two separate reasons to have this file, and only the first is about git:
#
#   - The monorepo's own .gitignore covers all of this, but `git subtree split` exports this
#     folder alone. The root's rules do not travel with it.
#   - Steam does not read .gitignore at all. SteamUGC.SetItemContent takes the junction's target
#     directory as it stands on disk, with no filtering, so anything sitting in the published
#     folder is published. That is what `Mod/` is for: the junction points there, and everything
#     else in this folder - Source/, the docs, this file - stays out of reach by construction.

# Build intermediates. Directory.Build.props sends them to .build/ at the repository root, but
# a build run from another directory can still drop them beside the csproj.
.build/
Source/obj/
Source/bin/

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings: each worktree is a full copy of the monorepo,
# hundreds of megabytes, and one has already landed inside a mod folder.
.claude/

# Showcase notes: French working notes, deleted once Preview.png and ModIcon.png are done.
PROMPT_*.md

# Development environments.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.csproj.user

# System.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
